### Run with: .\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run '-Dspring-boot.run.profiles=venue-dev'


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Đăng ký tài khoản (chỉ chạy lần đầu)
### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@cinema.local",
  "password": "Admin123!",
  "fullName": "Admin"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Đăng nhập — lấy token
### Response có "token". Copy giá trị đó → gán vào @token bên dưới.
### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@cinema.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### GÁN BIẾN TOKEN — Dán token thật từ response login vào đây
### ------------------------------------------------------------
@token = replace-with-returned-jwt-token


### Create a cinema, copy the returned id into {{cinemaId}}
POST http://localhost:8080/cinemas
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"name":"Aurora Cinema","address":"1 Main Street"}


### Set this from the previous response
@cinemaId = replace-with-returned-cinema-id


### Create a hall, copy the returned id into {{hallId}}
POST http://localhost:8080/halls
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"cinemaId":"{{cinemaId}}","name":"Hall A"}


### Set this from the previous response
@hallId = replace-with-returned-hall-id


### Create physical seats
POST http://localhost:8080/seats
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"hallId":"{{hallId}}","row":"A","number":1,"type":"NORMAL"}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST http://localhost:8080/seats
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"hallId":"{{hallId}}","row":"A","number":2,"type":"VIP"}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST http://localhost:8080/seats
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"hallId":"{{hallId}}","row":"B","number":1,"type":"COUPLE"}


### Read the hierarchy
### GET danh sách cinema
GET http://localhost:8080/cinemas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### GET chi tiết cinema
GET http://localhost:8080/cinemas/{{cinemaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### GET halls theo cinema
GET http://localhost:8080/cinemas/{{cinemaId}}/halls
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### GET chi tiết hall
GET http://localhost:8080/halls/{{hallId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### GET seats theo hall
GET http://localhost:8080/halls/{{hallId}}/seats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Expected errors: duplicate seat is 409; missing hall is 404
### Duplicate seat → mong đợi 409 Conflict
### Dùng đúng "A"/1 (giá trị đã lưu) để chắc chắn trùng.
POST http://localhost:8080/seats
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"hallId":"{{hallId}}","row":"A","number":1,"type":"NORMAL"}


### Missing hall → mong đợi 404 Not Found
### "missing-hall" là ID cố ý sai để test lỗi, không phải ID thật.
GET http://localhost:8080/halls/missing-hall/seats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### In-memory data is lost when the application restarts.